### Register once (skip if you already have a user)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "TestPass12345"
}

### Login and capture the token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "TestPass12345"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### List flags — default page, size 20
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/flags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Second page, 5 per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/flags?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Oldest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/flags?sort=createdAt,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
